    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Leave Here\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a walking simulator game. When you wake up from a hangover, you are in a strange corridor. You need to keep walking down, collect information, solve puzzles, and leave here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Story Background\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a hangover, you wake up and find yourself on the top floor of an apartment building, so you want to go down and leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, gradually, you find that things are not that simple. This staircase seems to have no end...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's worse is that there seems to be more than one person in this corridor...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623270/extras/a8696ce34fdebf8fbf2b489f5b9f8645.poster.avif?t=1743577439\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623270/extras/a8696ce34fdebf8fbf2b489f5b9f8645.webm?t=1743577439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623270/extras/a8696ce34fdebf8fbf2b489f5b9f8645.mp4?t=1743577439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Game Features\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Unreal 5 engine brings realistic horror visual and auditory effects, immersive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Realistic operation and interactive simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Layered interaction and narrative, creepy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623270/extras/82e8e09b666e39d2be484a73db9fad7f.poster.avif?t=1743577439\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623270/extras/82e8e09b666e39d2be484a73db9fad7f.webm?t=1743577439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623270/extras/82e8e09b666e39d2be484a73db9fad7f.mp4?t=1743577439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
